<html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>SubFuse Beta 0.13.1</title>
<h2>Saved usage widget fix</h2>
<p>Fixes a crash that could keep the widget from loading. When shared storage is unavailable, the widget can read the saved SubFuse profile file in Application Support. It has read-only access to that one file.</p>
<p>After updating, open SubFuse and select a profile with saved readings. To add the widget, Control-click the desktop, choose <strong>Edit Widgets</strong>, search for <strong>SubFuse</strong>, and add <strong>Saved usage</strong> in your preferred size.</p>
</html>
]]></description>
